{"ticker":"GILD","updated":"2026-11-06T23:58:31Z","profile":{"longName":"Gilead Sciences, Inc.","shortName":"Gilead Sciences, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - General","country":"United States","website":"https://www.gilead.com","fullTimeEmployees":17000,"marketCap":207000109056,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":16.536648,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.680009,"pegRatio":2.29,"targetMeanPrice":172.5,"targetHighPrice":200.0,"targetLowPrice":131.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.068,"earningsGrowth":-0.202,"grossMargins":0.79947,"operatingMargins":0.42433998,"profitMargins":-0.124630004,"totalRevenue":30987999232,"beta":0.372,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":176.58,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":116.88,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.96},"summary":"Gilead Sciences, Inc., a biopharmaceutical company, discovers, develops, and commercializes medicines in the areas of unmet medical need in the United States, Europe, and internationally. The company provides Biktarvy, Descovy, Genvoya, Odefsey, Sunlenca, Symtuza, and YeztugoFor the treatment of HIV-1 infection in patients. It also provides Epclusa, Livdelzi, and Vemlidy to treat chronic hepatitis C virus, primary biliary cholangitis, and chronic hepatitis B virus; Tecartus, a T-cell therapy for the treatment of adult patients; Trodelvy, an injection for intravenous use; and Yescarta, a suspension for intravenous infusion, is a CAR T-cell therapy for the treatment of adult patients. Further, it provides AmBisome, for the treatment of serious invasive fungal infections; and Veklury for the treatment of COVID-19. Additionally, the company engages in the development of various immunotherapies for patients with cancer and other incurable diseases. The company has collaboration agreements with Shenzhen Pregene Biopharma Co., Ltd.; Abingworth; Arcus Biosciences, Inc.; Merck Sharp & Dohme Corp.; Janssen Sciences Ireland Unlimited Company; Japan Tobacco, Inc.; Everest Medicines; Merck & Co, Inc.; Tentarix Biotherapeutics Inc.; and Assembly Biosciences, Inc. It also has research collaboration, option, and license agreement with Merus N.V. for the discovery of novel dual tumor-associated","summary_zh":"吉利德科學公司是一家生物製藥公司，在美國、歐洲和國際上未滿足醫療需求的領域中發現、開發和商業化藥物。該公司提供 Biktarvy、Descovy、Genvoya、Odefsey、Sunlenca、Symtuza 和 Yeztugo 用於治療 HIV-1 感染患者。另提供 Epclusa、Livdelzi 和 Vemlidy 用於治療慢性丙型肝炎病毒、原發性膽汁性膽管炎和慢性乙型肝炎病毒； Tecartus，一種用於治療成年患者的 T 細胞療法； Trodelvy，一種靜脈注射劑； Yescarta是一種用於靜脈輸注的混懸劑，是一種用於治療成年患者的CAR T細胞療法。此外，它還提供 AmBisome，用於治療嚴重的侵襲性真菌感染；和 Veklury 用於治療 COVID-19。此外，該公司也致力於為癌症和其他不治之症患者開發各種免疫療法。公司與深圳市普瑞金生物製藥有限公司有合作協議；阿賓沃斯； Arcus 生物科學公司；默沙東公司；楊森科學愛爾蘭有限公司；日本煙草公司；珠穆朗瑪峰藥品；默克公司； Tentarix 生物治療公司；它還與 Merus N.V. 簽訂了研究合作、選擇權和許可協議，以發現新型雙腫瘤相關藥物相關藥物相關藥物相關藥物","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"藥品製造商 - 一般","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":114.68,"h":116.18,"l":113.82,"c":115.88,"v":16945000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":115.88,"h":116.25,"l":113.87,"c":115.76,"v":6217200},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":115.54,"h":115.85,"l":114.5,"c":115.25,"v":7839700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":115.4,"h":118.11,"l":115.22,"c":117.86,"v":5457000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":117.49,"h":117.63,"l":114.18,"c":114.55,"v":6468100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":113.67,"h":113.67,"l":111.33,"c":112.54,"v":6168900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":113.22,"h":114.13,"l":110.15,"c":110.86,"v":5458800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":111.37,"h":112.46,"l":111.21,"c":112.26,"v":6539600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":111.4,"h":113.75,"l":111.26,"c":113.62,"v":7115600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":114.31,"h":115.07,"l":113.09,"c":114.09,"v":12580500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":113.45,"h":114.05,"l":112.15,"c":112.49,"v":7261300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":111.88,"h":115.57,"l":111.75,"c":114.4,"v":7281500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":114.3,"h":114.57,"l":111.96,"c":113.67,"v":5222500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":114.52,"h":115.25,"l":110.81,"c":110.99,"v":8355800},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":111.35,"h":112.24,"l":110.7,"c":112.1,"v":5074200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":112.55,"h":112.7,"l