c":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWnl5TFhVbWRGU2dKaVJhdV8tTEM4SWFCQWJhWGF4REZfUVVxQmlLeHJIWUtORFhTZlE5WHZDSkwxdU9JRHUzNDRUeW9KWkszNF94d2RhdHNFTXZlOGxjS3FyM0ZWUERhVzRnbGRfOF9jWDNWMGltT0Zaa1Z4NDNOT2ZkSHp6NzU5NUNnNC1rajJndEN5WHg4UWk5cnlVYjg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"吉利德科學公司（納斯達克股票代碼：GILD）2026 年第三季銷售額令人驚喜，全年前景略超預期"},{"title":"Gilead Q3 Adjusted Earnings, Revenue Rise; Updates Guidance","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOQ2lTWWxFU1pFS1NTM1N4RU1GVFU5Z0xuRFVJdzlnT2t4eGlxN1Qwb0Y3aUFPUE5LaGNHclcxR1E1UUdkQnRxemVQbVNET0VVUGVMZnJiZkE1dDlSblU5SHgtZU1hdXdCM1ZGcFlsUnl3VjJjY1ZCZlNOaGpIVzB4b2o4ZDBqVzQybndKZ2REWm54UkNlQ3p3eUxoWmc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"吉利德第三季調整後獲利、營收成長；更新指南"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/882095/000088209526000006/gild-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Gilead Sciences, Inc. (including its consolidated subsidiaries, referred to as \"Gilead,\" the \"company,\" \"we,\" \"our\" or \"us\") is a biopharmaceutical company that has pursued and achieved breakthroughs in medicine for more than three decades, with the goal of creating a healthier world for all people. We are committed to advancing innovative medicines to prevent and treat life-threatening diseases, including HIV, viral hepatitis, COVID-19 and cancer. We operate in more than 35 countries worldwide, with headquarters in Foster City, California.","zh":"吉利德科学公司（包括其合并子公司，称为“吉利德”、“公司”、“我们”、“我们的”）是一家生物制药公司，三十多年来一直在医学领域追求并取得突破，目标是为所有人创造一个更健康的世界。我们致力于开发创新药物来预防和治疗危及生命的疾病，包括 HIV、病毒性肝炎、COVID-19 和癌症。我們的業務遍及全球超過 35 個國家，總部位於加州福斯特城。"},{"en":"We have transformed care for people around the world by discovering, developing and delivering innovative medicines to address unmet medical needs in virology, oncology and other therapeutic areas. Our innovative medicines represent advancements by offering first-in-class therapies, greater efficacy, enhanced modes of delivery, more convenient treatment and prevention regimens, improved resistance profiles and reduced side effects.","zh":""},{"en":"In 2025, our commercial portfolio included more than 25 therapies, including the following products and collaboration products with approved indications in the U.S.:","zh":""}],"markets":[{"en":"We have transformed care for people around the world by discovering, developing and delivering innovative medicines to address unmet medical needs in virology, oncology and other therapeutic areas. Our innovative medicines represent advancements by offering first-in-class therapies, greater efficacy, enhanced modes of delivery, more convenient treatment and prevention regimens, improved resistance profiles and reduced side effects.","zh":""},{"en":"In 2025, our commercial portfolio included more than 25 therapies, including the following products and collaboration products with approved indications in the U.S.:","zh":""}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We operate in a highly competitive environment. Our products compete with other commercially available products based primarily on efficacy, safety, tolerability, acceptance by doctors, ease of patient compliance, ease of use, price, insurance and other reimbursement coverage, distribution and marketing. We also face significant competition from: (i) large pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies and specialized pharmaceutical firms acting either independently or together with other such companies to pursue the development of products and technologies that may be competitive with our existing products or research programs; (ii) academic institutions, government agencies and other public and private organizations conducting research who may seek patent protection or may establish collaborative arrangements for competitive products or programs; (iii) pricing pressures from private insure","zh":""},{"en":"Our research and development (\"R&D\") mission is to discover and develop transformational therapies in areas of high unmet medical need. Our product development efforts are focused primarily on virology, oncology and inflammation. Our team of research scientists is engaged in the discovery and development of new molecules and technologies that we hope will lead to the approval of innovative medicines and therapies that will transform care for people around the world. We have committed significant resources to internal R&D opportunities and external business development activity to drive innovation and growth of our business. We extensively outsource our clinical trial activities and usually perform only a small portion of start-up activities in-house. We rely on third-party contract research organizations to perform most of our clinical studies, including document preparation, site identi","zh":"我們的研發（「R&D」）使命是在醫療需求未被滿足的領域發現和開發轉化療法。我們的產品開發工作主要集中在病毒學、腫瘤學和發炎方面。我们的研究科学家团队致力于新分子和技术的发现和开发，我们希望这些新分子和技术能够促使创新药物和疗法获得批准，从而改变世界各地人们的护理方式。我們已將大量資源投入內部研發機會和外部業務發展活動中，以推動我們業務的創新和成長。我們廣泛地外包臨床試驗活動，通常只在內部執行一小部分啟動活動。我們依靠第三方合約研究組織來執行我們的大部分臨床研究，包括文件準備、場地識別"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"HIV Product Sales","val":20752000000,"zh":"愛滋病毒產品銷售"},{"name":"HIV Products Biktarvy","val":14334000000,"zh":"HIV 產品 Biktarvy"},{"name":"Oncology Product","val":3236000000,"zh":"腫瘤產品"},{"name":"Liver Disease","val":3217000000,"zh":"肝臟疾病"},{"name":"HIV Products Descovy","val":2758000000,"zh":"HIV 產品 Descovy"},{"name":"Cell Therapy Products Total Cell Therapy Product Sales","val":1839000000,"zh":"細胞治療產品 全細胞治療產品銷售"},{"name":"HIV Products Genvoya","val":1498000000,"zh":"HIV 產品 Genvoya"},{"name":"Other Products Yescarta","val":1495000000,"zh":"其他產品 Yescarta"},{"name":"Trodelvy","val":1397000000,"zh":"特羅德爾維"},{"name":"Liver Disease Products Sofosbuvir Velpatasvir","val":1272000000,"zh":"Liver Disease Products Sofosbuvir Velpatasvir"}],"total":29443000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":20876000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":5064000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Rest Of World","val":3503000000,"zh":"世界其他地區"}],"total":29443000000}},"peers":["AMGN","BIIB","ABBV","BMY","REGN"]}}